<figure class="bubble-check-map">
  <div class="bubble-check-drawing">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 320 350" role="img" aria-labelledby="bubble-check-map-title bubble-check-map-desc">
      <title id="bubble-check-map-title">Five places to check on a bubble mailer sample</title>
      <desc id="bubble-check-map-desc">An illustrative bag with numbered checks at the usable opening, side seam, adhesive flap, printed artwork and courier label. The adjacent list explains each check.</desc>
      <rect x="62" y="66" width="192" height="244" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#203c30" stroke-width="2" />
      <rect x="72" y="78" width="172" height="20" rx="3" fill="#f1f3ec" stroke="#536157" />
      <path d="M62 112H254M78 127V295M238 127V295" fill="none" stroke="#536157" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
      <rect x="104" y="221" width="110" height="63" rx="4" fill="#f1f3ec" stroke="#203c30" />
      <text x="158" y="183" text-anchor="middle">LOGO</text><text x="159" y="257" text-anchor="middle">LABEL</text>
      <g fill="#b63b10"><circle cx="158" cy="119" r="17" /><circle cx="62" cy="220" r="17" /><circle cx="254" cy="79" r="17" /><circle cx="101" cy="168" r="17" /><circle cx="226" cy="267" r="17" /></g>
      <g class="check-number" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central"><text x="158" y="119">1</text><text x="62" y="220">2</text><text x="254" y="79">3</text><text x="101" y="168">4</text><text x="226" y="267">5</text></g>
      <text x="160" y="33" text-anchor="middle">Review the filled sample</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption><strong>Check the bag with your actual contents</strong><ol><li><b>Opening &amp; fit:</b> insert the complete pack and record usable inner dimensions.</li><li><b>Liner &amp; seams:</b> inspect the proposed construction and any strain from the contents.</li><li><b>Flap &amp; adhesive:</b> close the filled bag using the agreed packing method.</li><li><b>Artwork &amp; finish:</b> compare the version, placement and retained physical reference.</li><li><b>Courier label:</b> check placement, adhesion and scanning with the intended label.</li></ol></figcaption>
</figure>
<p class="bubble-map-note">Sample-check illustration only. Agree the check methods, conditions and acceptance criteria for your order; the illustration does not represent a tested sample or a protection rating.</p>
<style>
  .bubble-check-map{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.85fr) minmax(0,1.15fr);gap:24px;align-items:center;margin:26px 0 12px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--white)}.bubble-check-drawing{min-width:0}.bubble-check-map svg{display:block;width:100%;max-width:340px;height:auto;margin-inline:auto}.bubble-check-map svg text{font:18px Inter,Arial,sans-serif;fill:var(--ink)}.bubble-check-map .check-number text{fill:white;font-weight:750}.bubble-check-map figcaption{min-width:0;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.65}.bubble-check-map figcaption>strong{display:block;color:var(--ink);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.4}.bubble-check-map ol{padding-left:22px;margin:18px 0 0}.bubble-check-map li{padding-left:3px;margin-bottom:12px}.bubble-map-note{font-size:.875rem!important;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}
  @media(max-width:760px){.bubble-check-map{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);padding:20px;gap:12px}.bubble-check-map svg{max-width:300px}}
</style>
